      "set": "De04",
      "source_number": 5,
      "source_page": 49,
      "field": "option.d",
      "rules": [
        "ascii-token:ket"
      ],
      "text": "4 gia i thi ch: * Router co n co ng => co n broadcast domain * 2 Router ket no i voi nhau => co 1 collision domain * ket no i truc tiep giu a Router va Switch => co 1 collision domain * Switch ket no i voi n pc => co n collision domain * Switch ket no i voi 1 Hub => co 1 collision domain * Hub ket no i voi n pc => chi co 1 collision domain * Bridge xem nhu Switch nhi n hinh ta tha y: 2 Router ket no i voi nhau qua Hub -> 1 collision domain be n tra i, Router ket no i truc tiep voi Switch -> 1 collision domain 1 Switch ket no i voi 2 pc -> 2 collision domain be n tra i, 1 Hub ket no i voi 2 pc -> 1 collision domain be n phai, 1 Hub ket no i voi 3 pc -> 1 collision domain to ng la 1 + 1 + 2 + 1 + 1 = 6"
    },
    {
      "id": "De04-17-210",
      "set": "De04",
      "source_number": 17,
